      "contribution": "Independent p = 1009 path sweep (130 paths, CP-SAT, determinant-checked selections), plateau lower bounds 712 (p = 101) and 213 (p = 31), reproduction of all controls, independent recomputation of the single-orbit, pairwise and path-cut arithmetic at both phases (T1 and T2), which found an error in the conflict-graph count and loose pair bounds at both phases, all corrected in this version, and the decided-pair method (\"both orbits full?\" feasibility) for loose pair bounds.",
